  "image_prompt": "Create a mysterious found-footage style photograph related to the event: Tank Truck and Motorcycle Collision at Phu Xuân 2 Bridge, Nha Be. Scene: A wide, grainy shot of the bridge at midnight, thick heavy fog swallowing the yellow streetlights, a distorted shadow of a massive fuel truck looming over a wrecked motorcycle, ethereal dark mist shaped like hands crawling from the asphalt, grainy texture, motion blur, unsettling atmosphere, 1990s VHS aesthetic, high contrast shadows, sickly green and cold blue color grading."
}
